{
  "LID": 68,
  "STAGE": 3,
  "TITLE": "Linking Words & Cohesion",
  "TITLE_AR": "أدوات الربط والتماسك النصي",
  "TIMER": 75,
  "XP": 50,
  "FULL_HTML": "\n<div style=\"font-family:'Cairo','Tajawal',sans-serif; line-height:1.8; color:#1a202c;\">\n\n<div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#667eea 0%,#764ba2 100%); color:white; padding:25px; border-radius:15px; margin-bottom:25px;\">\n<h1 style=\"margin:0; font-size:28px;\">🔗 Linking Words & Cohesion</h1>\n<h2 style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; opacity:0.95;\">أدوات الربط والتماسك النصي</h2>\n<p style=\"margin:15px 0 0; font-size:15px; opacity:0.9;\">📚 الدرس 23 من 25 | ⏱️ 75 ثانية/سؤال | 🎯 المستوى: B2</p>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7; border-right:5px solid #f59e0b; padding:18px; border-radius:10px; margin:20px 0;\">\n<h3 style=\"color:#92400e; margin-top:0;\">🎯 أهداف الدرس</h3>\n<ul style=\"margin:0; padding-right:25px;\">\n<li>إتقان <b>50+ أداة ربط</b> مصنفة حسب الوظيفة</li>\n<li>التمييز بين الأدوات المتشابهة (however vs although vs despite)</li>\n<li>استخدام أدوات الربط في الكتابة الأكاديمية</li>\n<li>تجنب الأخطاء الشائعة في علامات الترقيم مع أدوات الربط</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">📖 1. ما هي أدوات الربط؟</h2>\n<p>أدوات الربط (<b>Linking Words / Connectors / Transitions</b>) هي كلمات أو عبارات تربط بين الجمل والفقرات لتجعل النص متماسكاً ومنطقياً. وهي ضرورية في:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>✍️ <b>الكتابة الأكاديمية</b> (مقالات، أبحاث، تقارير)</li>\n<li>🗣️ <b>التحدث الرسمي</b> (عروض تقديمية، مناقشات)</li>\n<li>📖 <b>القراءة الأكاديمية</b> (TOEFL/IELTS Reading)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">🔗 2. التصنيف حسب الوظيفة</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#059669;\">A. الإضافة (Addition) — للإضافة والتأكيد</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#d1fae5;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\"><b>moreover</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">علاوة على ذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">The plan is cheap; moreover, it is effective.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\"><b>furthermore</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">فضلاً عن ذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">She is intelligent; furthermore, she is hardworking.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\"><b>in addition</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">بالإضافة إلى ذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">He speaks French; in addition, he knows Spanish.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\"><b>besides</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">إلى جانب ذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">It's late. Besides, I'm tired.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\"><b>not only ... but also</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">ليس فقط ... بل أيضاً</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;\">She is not only smart but also kind.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#dc2626;\">B. التضاد (Contrast) — للمعارضة والاستدراك</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fee2e2;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:10px;\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>however</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">ومع ذلك (بين جملتين)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">It rained. However, we went out.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>although / though</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">على الرغم من أن + S+V</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">Although it rained, we went out.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>despite / in spite of</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">على الرغم من + N/V-ing</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">Despite the rain, we went out.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>nevertheless</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">مع ذلك (رسمية)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">The task was hard; nevertheless, we finished it.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>on the other hand</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">من ناحية أخرى</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">Cars are fast; on the other hand, they pollute.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\"><b>whereas / while</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">بينما (مقارنة)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fca5a5; padding:8px;\">Tom is tall, whereas his brother is short.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed;\">C. السبب والنتيجة (Cause & Effect)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#ede9fe;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:10px;\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>because / since / as</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">لأن + S+V</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">He failed because he didn't study.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>because of / due to</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">بسبب + N</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">Flights were cancelled due to fog.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>therefore</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">لذلك (رسمية)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">He studied hard; therefore, he passed.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>thus / hence</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">وبالتالي</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">Prices rose; thus, sales dropped.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>consequently</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">نتيجة لذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">She missed the deadline; consequently, she lost the job.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>as a result</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">نتيجةً لذلك</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">It snowed heavily; as a result, schools closed.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\"><b>so that</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">لكي (غرض)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #c4b5fd; padding:8px;\">He worked hard so that he could pass.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#ea580c;\">D. الترتيب الزمني (Sequence)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#ffedd5;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\"><b>first / firstly / to begin with</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\">أولاً</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\"><b>second / next / then / afterwards</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\">ثانياً / بعد ذلك</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\"><b>meanwhile</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\">في غضون ذلك</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\"><b>finally / lastly / in conclusion</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fdba74; padding:8px;\">أخيراً / في الختام</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#0891b2;\">E. أمثلة وتوضيح (Examples & Clarification)</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#cffafe;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\"><b>for example / for instance</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\">على سبيل المثال</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\"><b>such as</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\">مثل (داخل الجملة)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\"><b>in other words</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\">بعبارة أخرى</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\"><b>that is (i.e.) / namely</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\">أي / وهي</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\"><b>to illustrate</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #67e8f9; padding:8px;\">للتوضيح</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#be123c;\">F. التلخيص والاستنتاج</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#ffe4e6;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:10px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:10px;\">المعنى</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\"><b>in conclusion / to conclude</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\">في الختام</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\"><b>in summary / to sum up</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\">باختصار</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\"><b>overall / on the whole</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\">بشكل عام</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\"><b>all in all</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fda4af; padding:8px;\">إجمالاً</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">⚖️ 3. التمييز بين الأدوات المتشابهة</h2>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7; padding:18px; border-radius:10px; margin:15px 0;\">\n<h3 style=\"color:#92400e; margin-top:0;\">🔍 although vs despite vs however</h3>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">الأداة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">يتبعها</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\"><b>although</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">جملة كاملة (S+V)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\"><b>Although</b> it was raining, we left.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\"><b>despite / in spite of</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">اسم أو V-ing</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\"><b>Despite</b> the rain, we left. / <b>Despite</b> raining, we left.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\"><b>however</b></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">جملة جديدة (بعد ;أو .)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #fbbf24; padding:8px;\">It was raining. <b>However</b>, we left.</td></tr>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#dbeafe; padding:18px; border-radius:10px; margin:15px 0;\">\n<h3 style=\"color:#1e3a8a; margin-top:0;\">🔍 because vs because of</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>because</b> + جملة كاملة: He left <b>because</b> <u>he was tired</u>.</li>\n<li><b>because of</b> + اسم/عبارة اسمية: He left <b>because of</b> <u>his tiredness</u>.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fce7f3; padding:18px; border-radius:10px; margin:15px 0;\">\n<h3 style=\"color:#831843; margin-top:0;\">🔍 so vs such</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>so</b> + adjective/adverb: It was <b>so</b> hot that we couldn't sleep.</li>\n<li><b>such</b> + (a/an) + adj + noun: It was <b>such</b> a hot day that we couldn't sleep.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">⚠️ 4. الأخطاء الشائعة</h2>\n<ol style=\"background:#fef2f2; padding:18px 35px; border-radius:10px;\">\n<li>❌ <b>Although</b> the rain, we left. → ✅ <b>Despite</b> the rain, we left.</li>\n<li>❌ He failed <b>because of</b> he didn't study. → ✅ He failed <b>because</b> he didn't study.</li>\n<li>❌ <b>Despite</b> she was tired, she worked. → ✅ <b>Although</b> she was tired, she worked.</li>\n<li>❌ He is smart, <b>however</b> he is lazy. → ✅ He is smart; <b>however</b>, he is lazy. (semicolon!)</li>\n<li>❌ <b>Moreover</b> he is rich, he is generous. → ✅ He is rich; <b>moreover</b>, he is generous.</li>\n<li>❌ It was <b>so</b> hot day. → ✅ It was <b>such</b> a hot day.</li>\n<li>❌ <b>In spite</b> the rain → ✅ <b>In spite of</b> the rain</li>\n<li>❌ <b>For example</b>, like pizza. → ✅ <b>For example</b>, pizza is popular. / I like Italian food <b>such as</b> pizza.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">🎯 5. علامات الترقيم مع أدوات الربط</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#ecfdf5; padding:18px; border-radius:10px;\">\n<p>✅ <b>القاعدة الذهبية:</b> أدوات الربط في بداية الجملة تأخذ <b>فاصلة (,)</b> بعدها:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>However<b>,</b> ... / Moreover<b>,</b> ... / Therefore<b>,</b> ... / Nevertheless<b>,</b> ...</li>\n</ul>\n<p>✅ بين جملتين مستقلتين: استخدم <b>فاصلة منقوطة (;)</b> قبل الأداة:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>He studied hard<b>;</b> however<b>,</b> he failed.</li>\n<li>It was late<b>;</b> therefore<b>,</b> we left.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">💡 6. حيل التذكر (Memory Tricks)</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7; padding:18px; border-radius:10px;\">\n<ul>\n<li>🧠 <b>Although + S+V</b> | <b>Despite + N/V-ing</b> | <b>However + . (جملة جديدة)</b></li>\n<li>🧠 <b>Because + جملة</b> | <b>Because of + اسم</b></li>\n<li>🧠 <b>So + صفة</b> | <b>Such + (a/an) + صفة + اسم</b></li>\n<li>🧠 الأدوات الرسمية (moreover/furthermore/nevertheless/consequently) — للكتابة الأكاديمية</li>\n<li>🧠 الأدوات غير الرسمية (besides/so/but/and) — للمحادثة</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#1e40af; border-bottom:3px solid #3b82f6; padding-bottom:8px;\">📝 7. مراجعة سريعة (Quick Recap)</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; margin:15px 0;\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1e3a8a; color:white;\"><th style=\"border:1px solid #1e40af; padding:10px;\">الوظيفة</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #1e40af; padding:10px;\">الأدوات الأكثر استخداماً</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">➕ إضافة</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">moreover, furthermore, in addition, besides</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">↔️ تضاد</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">however, although, despite, nevertheless, whereas</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">➡️ سبب/نتيجة</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">because, due to, therefore, thus, consequently</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">📅 ترتيب</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">first, then, meanwhile, finally</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">🔍 توضيح</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">for example, such as, in other words</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">📌 تلخيص</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;\">in conclusion, overall, to sum up</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n<br><h2 style='color:#1e40af;'>📝 15 جملة نموذجية</h2><table style='width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;'><tr style='background:#1e40af; color:white;'><th style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:10px;'>#</th><th style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:10px;'>English</th><th style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:10px;'>عربي</th><th style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:10px;'>ملاحظة</th></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>1</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>Moreover</b>, the company increased its profit by 20% this year.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>علاوة على ذلك، زادت الشركة أرباحها بنسبة 20% هذا العام.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>moreover = إضافة في الكتابة الرسمية</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>2</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>Although</b> she was exhausted, she finished the project on time.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>على الرغم من أنها كانت منهكة، أنهت المشروع في الوقت المحدد.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>although + S+V</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>3</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>Despite</b> the heavy traffic, we arrived early.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>على الرغم من الازدحام الشديد، وصلنا مبكراً.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>despite + اسم</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>4</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>He failed the exam <b>because</b> he didn't prepare enough.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>رسب في الامتحان لأنه لم يستعد بما يكفي.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>because + جملة كاملة</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>5</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>The match was cancelled <b>because of</b> the bad weather.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>أُلغيت المباراة بسبب سوء الطقس.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>because of + اسم</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>6</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>She studied hard; <b>therefore</b>, she passed with distinction.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>درست بجد؛ لذلك نجحت بامتياز.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>therefore بعد ; وقبل , </td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>7</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>Furthermore</b>, the research highlights the need for more funding.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>فضلاً عن ذلك، يبرز البحث الحاجة إلى مزيد من التمويل.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>furthermore رسمية جداً</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>8</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>The plan was risky; <b>however</b>, it succeeded in the end.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>كانت الخطة محفوفة بالمخاطر؛ ومع ذلك، نجحت في النهاية.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>however بين جملتين</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>9</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>In addition to</b> English, he speaks French and German.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>بالإضافة إلى الإنجليزية، يتحدث الفرنسية والألمانية.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>in addition to + اسم</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>10</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>Cars are convenient; <b>on the other hand</b>, they cause pollution.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>السيارات مريحة؛ من ناحية أخرى، تسبب التلوث.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>on the other hand لإظهار وجهة نظر مقابلة</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>11</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>For instance</b>, many students struggle with academic writing.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>على سبيل المثال، يعاني كثير من الطلاب من الكتابة الأكاديمية.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>for instance = for example</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>12</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>He arrived late; <b>consequently</b>, he missed the opening speech.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>وصل متأخراً؛ ونتيجة لذلك، فاتته كلمة الافتتاح.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>consequently = as a result</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>13</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>Whereas</b> the north is cold, the south is warm year-round.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>بينما الشمال بارد، الجنوب دافئ طوال العام.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>whereas للمقارنة</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>14</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'>It was <b>such</b> an interesting book <b>that</b> I read it twice.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>كان كتاباً ممتعاً جداً لدرجة أنني قرأته مرتين.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>such + a/an + صفة + اسم + that</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; text-align:center;'>15</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;'><b>To sum up</b>, technology has transformed every aspect of life.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>باختصار، حوّلت التكنولوجيا كل جانب من جوانب الحياة.</td><td style='border:1px solid #93c5fd; padding:8px; font-size:13px; color:#6b7280;'>to sum up للختام في المقالات</td></tr></table><br><h2 style='color:#1e40af;'>📚 18 مفردة أساسية</h2><table style='width:100%; border-collapse:collapse;'><tr style='background:#059669; color:white;'><th style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;'>الكلمة</th><th style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;'>النطق</th><th style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;'>عربي</th><th style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:10px;'>مثال</th></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>moreover</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/mɔːrˈoʊvər/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>علاوة على ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Moreover, the data confirms our hypothesis.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>furthermore</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˈfɜːrðərmɔːr/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>فضلاً عن ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Furthermore, costs have risen sharply.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>however</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/haʊˈevər/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>ومع ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>However, the results were surprising.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>although</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ɔːlˈðoʊ/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>على الرغم من أن</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Although tired, he kept working.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>despite</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/dɪˈspaɪt/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>على الرغم من</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Despite the cold, they swam.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>nevertheless</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˌnevərðəˈles/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>مع ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>It was hard; nevertheless, we succeeded.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>therefore</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˈðerfɔːr/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>لذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>He studied; therefore, he passed.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>consequently</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˈkɑːnsəkwentli/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>نتيجةً لذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>He overslept; consequently, he was late.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>thus</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ðʌs/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>وبالتالي</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Prices rose; thus, demand fell.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>hence</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/hens/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>ومن ثم</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>He is sick; hence, he stayed home.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>whereas</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/werˈæz/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>بينما</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Tom is tall, whereas Tim is short.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>meanwhile</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˈmiːnwaɪl/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>في غضون ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>She cooked; meanwhile, he set the table.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>besides</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/bɪˈsaɪdz/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>إلى جانب ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>It's late. Besides, I'm tired.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>moreover</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/mɔːrˈoʊvər/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>علاوة على ذلك</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Moreover, evidence supports this view.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>in conclusion</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ɪn kənˈkluːʒən/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>في الختام</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>In conclusion, action is needed.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>overall</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˌoʊvərˈɔːl/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>بشكل عام</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Overall, the report is positive.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>such as</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/sʌtʃ æz/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>مثل</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Fruits such as apples are healthy.</td></tr><tr><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'><b>namely</b></td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px; color:#7c3aed;'>/ˈneɪmli/</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;' dir='rtl'>وهي / أي</td><td style='border:1px solid #6ee7b7; padding:8px;'>Two countries, namely France and Spain, agreed.</td></tr></table>"
}